    <bpmn:process id="W_W3304" name="W3304. Merchandise KPI Dashboard, Category Scorecard &amp; Executive Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly executive review; board reporting (links to VS-33.2/VS-36.1)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Group + category level
Owner: VP Merchandising
Participants: VP Merchandising, Merchandise Planners, BI (links to VS-28.1), FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), CEO/COO/CFO
Source: workflow W3304 — Merchandise KPI Dashboard, Category Scorecard &amp; Executive Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3304_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3304_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3304_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3304_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3304_Lane2" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3304_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3304_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3304_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3304_Start4" name="Monthly executive review; board reporting (links to VS-33.2/VS-36.1)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3304_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3304_Task5" name="Merchandise Planner/BI maintain the merchandise KPI dashboard and category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner/BI maintain the merchandise KPI dashboard and category scorecard: sales, GM%, turn, GMROI, sell-through, in-stock, markdown %, OTB utilization, aged-inventory %, vendor margin, channel mix — vs plan and LY
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / BI
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3304_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3304_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3304_Task6" name="VP Merchandising conduct monthly category scorecard review with Category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Merchandising conduct monthly category scorecard review with Category Managers; recognize top performers, action underperformers, and reallocate OTB/space (links to VS-55.3) and people focus
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3304_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3304_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3304_Task7" name="VP Merchandising present merchandise results to executive committee and board…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Merchandising present merchandise results to executive committee and board (links to VS-33.2/VS-36.1): performance vs plan, margin outlook, inventory health, key risks (links to VS-21.2), and strategic recommendations
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Monthly/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3304_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3304_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3304_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3304_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3304_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-534 (ensure controlled execution — Merchandise Performance Analytics &amp; Margin Optimization (PA-101.3).) | - operational: balanced scorecard; operational: near-real-time BI (links to VS-28)
Owner: VP Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3304_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3304_Annotation9" targetRef="W3304_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
